      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12156/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk sugar and cornstarch together in a saucepan until completely blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S2vDAVgZsAmgqUSwl63NrhDvDjE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12156-fresh-strawberry-pie-i-step-2-e486b38f24424efc9b99ce4ca623a2b6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12156/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in boiling water and cook over medium heat until mixture thickens and is clear in color, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OQ9YG-FeaQP7fD5BfH4fKiWyiZ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12156-fresh-strawberry-pie-i-step-3-6a9a86a3a04c4b2f92696b6e9a314033.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12156/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat and stir in gelatin mix until smooth. Let mixture cool to room temperature, 15 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lLl6AwR92e5Dvh-hDd1OIKNW7_o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12156-fresh-strawberry-pie-i-step-4-bee56b9e572d40ee857113fa82feaddf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12156/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the mixture is cooling, place strawberries into baked pie shells with the points facing up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pq8e7n1zyGs2HuP24NsWw2bWe2g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12156-fresh-strawberry-pie-i-step-5-8a6a76506aea431692bc529786825f23.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12156/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
